WEBVTT

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:09.330
Die.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.290
Letting your guard down against a child, huh?

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:24.750
The dagger that struck you is coated with
a poison- and paralysis-inflicting potion.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:36.040
How infuriating! How dare this
immortal monster ignore <i>me</i> !

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:42.660
No matter, my anger should subside
once I become the immortal King of Corpses.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:46.040
The conditions to turn 5,000 years'
worth of life into Undead

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.330
and create the Crystal of Resentment...

00:00:48.330 --> 00:00:52.620
It took a long time, but I'm finally
close to fulfilling them.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:55.160
Now all that's left is to kill
the rest of the children

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:57.700
and turn them into materials for the Undea--

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.160
Hm?

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.620
If you're the one responsible
for that awful scene...

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:10.910
And if you say you're going to
continue creating ones like it...

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:17.500
Then I <i>will</i> ... kill you.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.700
Then I <i>will</i> ... kill you.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.700
"Chapter 6:
 Beyond the Radix Point"

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:54.620
Abyss Delusion! Dead Man's Bind!

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.580
  "Ray Starling"         "Death Sentence"  "Weakness"
                             "Deterioration"       "Binding"
                               "Doom"                  "Lethargy"

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:57.620
"Ray Starling"      "Holy Revival"        "Vitality"
                              "Strength Boost" "Speed Boost"
                               "Blessing"          "Fighting Spirit"

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:02.500
Why won't he stop...?

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:08.500
This is bad. I may be a Lich,

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.370
but if I'm struck by his weapon
with Purifying Silverlight,

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.370
even I won't be able to regenerate.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:16.370
Awaken Undead!

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:34.950
How can a Master--one of those
immortal monsters--be so furious?

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:51.250
Gouz! Gouz!

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.160
Wha...?!

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:58.660
Choose...

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:02.120
Hell or divine punishment. Which will it be?

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:05.620
This is absurd! <i>Absurd</i> !

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:10.870
I can't die now! I'm so close to
becoming the King of Corpses!

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:14.830
Very well, I'll give you the divine
punishment you so desire.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:33.000
The Crystal of Resentment... The very thing
I need to become the King of Corpses.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.750
But If I die now... it'll all be meaningless!

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.370
In that case!

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:41.040
I'll use it so only <i>I</i> am
the one left standing!

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:44.870
<i>This</i> is the strongest offensive
magic a Lich can wield!

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:48.410
Deadly Mixer!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.620
Counter Absorption!

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:59.620
I-Impossible!

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:10.700
There's nowhere else to run.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:13.290
W-W-Wait! Let's make a deal!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:16.330
I'll give you money! I have 70 million lir!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:20.540
I'll give you all of it! Just please spare me!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:25.120
I see, so it's money you want?

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:25.830
No.

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:27.370
What?

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:29.660
Your life is enough for me.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:37.660
"Ray Starling"      "Holy Revival"        "Vitality"
                              "Strength Boost" "Speed Boost"
                               "Blessing"          "Fighting Spirit"

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:38.540
  "Ray Starling"         "Death Sentence"  "Weakness"
                               "Deterioration"       "Binding"
                                "Doom"                  "Lethargy"
                               "Bleeding"                "Poison"

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:43.870
The fact that the reverse effect on my debuffs
has worn off means he's dead, huh?

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:47.040
Master! Do you have any anti-debuff potions?

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:50.870
I didn't anticipate getting this kind of debuff.

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:56.580
Damn that horse zombie!
Leaving us with this lousy parting gift!

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.330
Here, drink this.

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.870
Hugo? Is that...?

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:07.080
An Elixir and High Spirit Water
that removes curses.

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:07.160
                                "Weakness"
  "Deterioration"       "Binding"
"Doom"                 "Lethargy"

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:07.660
                              "Cure"
"Deterioration"       "Binding"
"Doom"                 "Lethargy"

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:08.200
"Cure"                     "Binding"
"Doom"                 "Lethargy"

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:08.660
                                 "Cure"
"Doom"                 "Lethargy"

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:09.160
"Cure"                          "Lethargy"

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:09.540
"Cure"

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.910
Thanks, Hugo.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.660
You're very welcome.

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:18.330
Is that his inventory?

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:22.200
What will you do, Ray?
You defeated him. It's yours now.

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.250
I have no interest in touching
that monster's things.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.250
I agree.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:33.120
Anyway, I want to start getting
those children out of the dungeon...

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.950
Where's Cyco?

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.290
Come here, Cyco.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.370
Are you sure?

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.580
Yeah, it's okay.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.830
Yoo-hoo!

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:53.870
I see. So you're just like me.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:58.120
Yes! My real name is Cocytus!

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:00.540
So the crest on your hand before?

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:04.080
It's the Maiden skill: Crest Disguise.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:06.540
Such a skill exists?

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:08.950
The children are waiting, Ray.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.450
Right!

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.910
It seems luck has turned in our favor.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:22.290
Yeah, we made a run for it,
and then we come back to <i>this</i> .

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:25.660
Let's take the items and
the kids and get outta here!

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:27.870
It's the boss's inventory.

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:29.580
Let's break it open!

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.120
Yeah!

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:39.120
Hell yeah! There's so much money!

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:42.450
Hm, what's this?

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:44.410
Activating.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:46.330
Hm? What's wrong?

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.830
It's stuck to my hand! I can't get it off!

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:52.160
Damage to inventory: Confirmed.

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:55.120
Termination of Lich Maise: Confirmed.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:58.250
Deduction: Plundering by hostiles.

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:03.120
Invoking retaliation skill:
Grudge Undead Creation.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.620
H-Help!

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:42.540
Monster that meets the criteria to be
recognized as a UBM has been discovered.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:46.660
Approval from Control AI
in charge of UBMs: Received.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:51.540
Recognizing target as UBM.
Target assigned Epic tier status.

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:55.370
Target is henceforth named
Revenant Ox-Horse, Gouz-Maise.

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:05.000
What the hell is that?!

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:09.080
"Revenant Ox-Horse, Gouz-Maise"

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:09.080
Gouz-Maise?!

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:14.000
It would seem the monster is made from
the corpses that were lying around over there.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.330
What should we do?

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:18.620
We lack attack power. And my weapons are...

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:23.080
I've only got one more use
of Counter Absorption left.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:27.330
I'm not confident I can hold out till I can
charge enough energy to defeat that thing.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.120
I'll die for sure.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:30.870
You're right...

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.290
Huh?

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:33.250
What's wrong?

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:37.450
It's just... I'm getting this strange feeling
from my damage counter.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:40.370
It's gone... Was it just my imagination?

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.580
Oh, no!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.790
Purgatorial Flames: Full Blast!

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:03.290
Hugo! Take the children and run!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.830
But you can't do this alone.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.290
I know! But still...

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:13.450
We have to save the children!

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:14.910
Got it!

00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:25.830
All right, I'll buy them some time!

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:28.660
What the--?

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:34.580
It can use Auto Restoration it seems.

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:39.160
Our normal attacks are meaningless
if it can regenerate that fast.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:42.580
If we can just get Counter Absorption
to full charge, then...

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.950
Huh? It's that feeling again...

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:45.750
What's wrong?

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:49.200
There's this strange feeling
coming from my damage counter.

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.750
It's gone...

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:03.540
His movements are different from before.

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:08.200
The Lich inside it is probably enraged
by the sight of his sworn enemy.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:13.250
Well, this is annoying.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:16.620
But... there is a silver lining.

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:17.830
Where?

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:22.910
Because of its attack, I now know
what that strange feeling was earlier.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:24.160
What?

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:27.410
It's because we've already collected
more than enough damage from it.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.790
And what's more,
it's the most we've ever collected.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:34.500
It's most likely because we absorbed
that last spell the Lich released.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:38.830
Wait, aren't the Lich and Gouz-Maise separate--?

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:41.910
Multiple grudges are controlling that thing...

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:45.250
That's right. If we time it to when
the Lich's grudge is in control,

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:47.790
the damage we've collected
should be effective against it.

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:52.620
If we hit it with Vengeance when
the Lich's grudge is in control, then...

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:55.500
Then there's a possibility
we may be able to defeat it.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:59.370
In that case, I'll wager it all
on that possibility!

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:05.750
Beast who has caused those children
to suffer, took the lives of many,

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:08.950
and yet still resents the living...

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:13.370
We won't allow you to take any more lives!

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:16.660
We will defeat you!

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:23.450
One more direct hit and it's over!

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:25.000
I know!

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:31.080
Purgatorial Flames!

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:40.330
If we don't find its core and hit it soon,
I'll have no stamina left!

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:44.040
Master! Our damage count disappeared!

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:49.250
Damn it! The grudge controlling
it must have switched!

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.250
What should we do?

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:52.620
I have an idea.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:53.870
Got it!

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:05.160
This is bad! It's going after
Hugo and the others!

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.200
I'll cut it down!

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:16.750
You better not die, Ray.

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:27.580
I'm not done yet!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.870
That reaction just now!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.620
Yeah, its core is in its head!

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:40.200
In that case...

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:42.580
I'm finishing this now.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:53.410
It's back! The Lich is back in control!

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:55.750
Now we can cut it!

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:05.700
Let's slice this thing!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:18.120
All right, I got its head!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.000
The core.

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:23.370
Deadly Mixer!

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:25.500
Counter Absorption!

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:31.330
I can't dodge that!

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:33.450
I won't let you die!

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:40.540
Ray!

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.370
"Ray Starling"                              "Fainted"
                                    "Broken Bone"
                                    "Broken Bone"
                                    "Broken Bone"

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.080
This is bad!

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.370
"Ray Starling"

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:50.910
It's no use. His wounds are too deep.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:54.700
I won't let him die. I won't let you die!

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.200
Forgive me.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:14.540
"Ray Starling"

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:14.540
His life shouldn't be in danger for now.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:20.870
I won't let it happen.

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:26.330
I won't let my Master--I won't let Ray
be killed by that monster!

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:28.790
I believe in you.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:33.410
We made a vow that evening. A vow
to grow strong together and seize victory.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:37.120
You're going to wake up soon.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:41.160
And when you do,
we'll surely come out victorious!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:49.080
Here goes nothing!

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:02.910
A dream... from that time my brother
was competing in that fighting tournament.

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:04.290
Replay.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:08.160
Replay? So this is your doing?

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:18.200
Crap! Yep, it's definitely broken.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:22.200
If I... hadn't have... jumped out...

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:23.790
Reiji.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:28.540
You would have regretted it more
if you <i>hadn't</i> tried to save her.

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:31.120
You could have saved her without me!

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:35.830
But it's <i>because</i> you tried to save her
that I realized what was happening.

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:40.830
So in the end, it was <i>your</i>
<i>choice</i> that saved her.

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:43.950
There's no reason to ever regret
the choices you make.

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:49.290
Making choices is an important part of
grabbing hold of the future you desire.

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:53.080
Once you make a choice, what comes next
is whether you're able to see it or not--

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:55.500
grab hold of it or not.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:00.790
The possibility always exists
if you have the will to pursue it.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:05.660
No matter how many zeros
there are past the radix point,

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.290
the possibility always exists.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:13.790
The only time there isn't one is when you give
up on grabbing hold of the future you desire.

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:17.790
As long as you don't give up and keep making
choices towards the future you want,

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:22.330
the possibility will never disappear--
no matter how far beyond the radix point it is.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:27.540
The words my brother said
that day... left a mark on me.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:32.910
And that's why your choice to save
that girl was not a mistake.

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:34.790
Shuichi...

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:37.700
Today I'll show you...

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:44.500
...how to put your all into
grabbing hold of a possibility.

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:50.620
<i>This</i> is what it means to
grab hold of a possibility!

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.540
He's an... intense brother.

00:17:58.540 --> 00:17:59.410
Yeah, I guess he is.

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:04.370
Desperate times call for
desperate measures.

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:09.330
Yeah. Even if I'm in a worse condition
than before, I know I can beat it!

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:12.450
I see. Then wake up.

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:17.160
By the way, what are you?

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:22.250
You'll never master me
if you only use my flames, Ray.

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.830
You're... Gardran--

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.580
I am just a fragment.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:30.500
A power left unused after having been
defeated whilst still incomplete.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:33.700
I am the life and mind the ogre
failed to give birth to.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:37.370
The life that was reborn as your item.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:42.250
I now understand you.
Now, please, understand me.

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:49.250
Alongside Nemesis, use me and give your all
to grab ahold of the possibility, okay?

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:54.410
I won't last much longer at this rate!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:58.950
Are you perhaps annoyed
that you cannot defeat me?!

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:06.200
I won't be able to dodge them all.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:10.250
This is how strong I am on my own.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:13.370
But I can't hold on much longer than this...

00:19:13.370 --> 00:19:17.040
So... So won't you come back already?!

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:18.450
Okay!

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:25.830
You sure took your time, Ray.

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:30.120
My bad. I was dreaming and overslept a little.

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:33.290
You shouldn't keep a lady waiting, you know?

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:35.750
Thanks, Nemesis.

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.750
Well, at least you made it.

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:40.160
So? Shall we do this?

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:42.580
I have a plan, but...

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:46.160
The chance of success is low?

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.580
But if the possibility exists...

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:51.500
...all that's left to do is bet it all on it!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.290
Let's win this, shall we?

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:56.330
Let's win this!

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:07.700
Hellish Miasma! Full Blast!

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:20.330
Deadly Mixer!

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:36.250
If you get a debuff from ingesting
a part of a debuffed opponent's body,

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:41.040
Like a Flag Flying the Reversal registers it
as a negative effect caused by the opponent.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:44.910
I guess this is the first time <i>you've</i>
been the one to get eaten, huh?

00:20:56.500 --> 00:21:01.450
Deadly Mixer!

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:05.750
It's over!

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:09.160
Beast consumed by immortality...

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:12.200
...sleep for all eternity!

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:15.370
Vengeance is Mine!

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:32.410
Encountering and defeating two UBMs
one day after the other. Fascinating.

00:21:34.120 --> 00:21:36.750
Grudge-Soaked Greaves, Gouz-Maise, huh?

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:41.830
The "Rider and Horse, As One" skill--
it means you can finally ride Silver.

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:46.950
The other skill turns grudge
energy into MP or SP.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:53.040
Will you leave this world?

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:55.910
This world is overflowing with death.

00:21:55.910 --> 00:22:01.040
I'm not sure whether putting myself
through this is a good idea or a bad one.

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:04.120
But it's not all loss.

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:08.200
You'll likely face more hardship
if you stay, you know?

00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:12.080
If something that puts a bad taste in
my mouth happens in front of me again...

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:14.370
...I'll just put an end to it.

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:17.200
I'll put my all into grabbing that possibility.

00:22:17.200 --> 00:22:21.410
I see. You should fight to protect others.

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:23.120
And while you do...

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:25.620
... <i>I'll</i> be the one protecting <i>you</i> .

00:22:29.790 --> 00:22:33.200
Thanks... Nemesis...

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:41.620
Well, you two sure have been busy, huh?

00:22:41.620 --> 00:22:46.910
To think you'd go cleaning up those bandits
that were terrorizing the town.

00:22:46.910 --> 00:22:48.660
So you know about that?

00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:51.700
I've been wiretapping Ray, after all.

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:55.200
You wiretapped Ray? How?

00:22:55.200 --> 00:22:57.830
That's. A. Secret.

00:22:57.830 --> 00:23:01.160
Well, if you know what he's been up to,
then I'd like to ask you something...

00:23:01.160 --> 00:23:05.080
Ah, yes. He defeated the UBM all by himself.

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:08.870
I see. I'm glad.

00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:14.540
But someone like him is sure
to try and stop our plan.

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:17.000
There's absolutely nothing to worry about, Hugh.

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:21.660
If our plan goes well, the war will end
with only minimal casualties.

00:23:21.660 --> 00:23:24.410
Only minimal?

00:23:24.410 --> 00:23:29.660
His Excellency the General wants all-out war.

00:23:29.660 --> 00:23:34.950
But if we're going to do this, it has to be done
in a way that's elegant yet exciting.

00:23:34.950 --> 00:23:38.910
Tomorrow, we, the Triangle of Wisdom,

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:43.580
will bring an end to the war between
the imperium and the kingdom.

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:48.370
"The Dueling Cities"

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:47.330
"The Dueling Cities."
